### ============================================================
### VARIABLES — fill these in before running
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@carOwnerToken = PASTE_CAR_OWNER_JWT_HERE
@shopToken = PASTE_SHOP_JWT_HERE
@leadId = 1
@quoteId = 1

### ============================================================
### NEARBY LEADS
### ============================================================

### 1. Get nearby leads (REPAIR_SHOP)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shops/leads/nearby
Authorization: Bearer {{shopToken}}

### ============================================================
### SUBMIT QUOTE
### ============================================================

### 2. Submit a quote (REPAIR_SHOP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{shopToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leadId": {{leadId}},
  "price": 5500.00,
  "message": "I can fix this within 2 days"
}

### 3. Submit duplicate quote on same lead (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{shopToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leadId": {{leadId}},
  "price": 4000.00,
  "message": "Trying again"
}

### ============================================================
### GET QUOTES
### ============================================================

### 4. Get quotes for lead (CAR_OWNER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{carOwnerToken}}

### ============================================================
### ACCEPT QUOTE
### ============================================================

### 5. Accept a quote (CAR_OWNER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{carOwnerToken}}

### 6. Try accepting again on same lead (should fail — lead is CLOSED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{carOwnerToken}}

### ============================================================
### SUBMIT QUOTE ON CLOSED LEAD
### ============================================================

### 7. Submit quote on closed lead (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{shopToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leadId": {{leadId}},
  "price": 3000.00,
  "message": "Trying to quote closed lead"
}

### ============================================================
### DB VERIFICATION QUERIES
### (run these in your PostgreSQL client)
### ============================================================
### SELECT * FROM quotes WHERE lead_id = 1;
### → new row with status = PENDING
###
### SELECT * FROM quotes WHERE lead_id = 1;
### → accepted quote: status = ACCEPTED
### → all other quotes: status = REJECTED
###
### SELECT status FROM leads WHERE id = 1;
### → status = CLOSED
### ============================================================

### ============================================================
### WEBSOCKET TEST
### ============================================================
### Open https://www.piesocket.com/websocket-tester
### or use browser console:
###
### Connect to:
### ws://localhost:8080/ws/websocket
###
### After connecting send STOMP CONNECT frame:
### CONNECT
### Authorization:Bearer YOUR_JWT_HERE
### accept-version:1.2
### heart-beat:0,0
###
### (blank line then null byte \0 to terminate)
###
### Expected: CONNECTED frame back from server
###
### Then subscribe:
### SUBSCRIBE
### id:sub-0
### destination:/topic/leads/1/quotes
###
### Then fire request #2 (submit quote)
### → quote JSON should appear in WS tester
### ============================================================